  "note": "PARKED 2026-11-06 (Rodney, timing trim): not run. The compiler is judged statically (docs/207 §8.5), every A/B here is a measurement, no go or stop, and no Direct=1 go/no-go needs it: Direct=1 is gated by jit-reader-trap, jit-verify and the clean night (docs/537 §6). Kept on file for a later look. jit-ab: [MonoJit] timing in one load per job (docs/527 §5, audit row C4; ts3native 0.36.173, counters v911, asi game-copy/ts3native.asi.mono1106c from master 000589df), BP / IP / SV, off-first and on-first, 10 min, --ab jit 2-min slices flipping jitSwitch (0 = EA's opcode words, 1 = the compiled entry). First number: Mode=1, Direct=0, Inline=0, Wide=0 (S1 with the list of docs/537 §8). Second arm set, *-jit-d1-ab*: Mode=1, Direct=1, DirectLeaf=0, Inline=0, Wide=0, same worlds, same reads. Direct is read once at install ([MonoJit] ini, monojit.cpp), --ab jit flips only jitSwitch, so Direct=1 vs off is in-load A/B and Direct=1 vs Direct=0 is cross-run ABBA per world (jobs run A B B A; IP adds A B): compare each *-jit-d1-ab* on arm with its world's *-jit-ab* on arm, X3 ms/s and X4 us per 100 rounds, each job's own off arm as the drift anchor. No in-load Direct flip and no reader for the cross-run line: read the two arm-ms / fixedwork lines side by side. The d1 jobs also need jit-verify's *-jit-lazy-chain jobs passed and jit-reader-trap at jitTrapUnknown 0 (Direct=1 cannot ship with an unknown reader). A later round sets Inline 2, Wide 1 in each job's ini. [AutShadow] is off in every job (arm stated, docs/223 §4 point 4). Run only after jit-reader-trap and jit-verify passed. Quiet machine, IDE and java closed; the jobs need a ts3agent package with fixed_work in game Bin (docs/244). queue.ts runs the measurement smoke first. A measurement, not a go or stop: no ms/s bar (docs/527 §5, docs/207 §8.5); the lane stops only on a failed correctness gate. Read per job: node tools/harness/arm-ms.ts jit-ab (X3: per-arm ms/s columns, taskObjects, threaded, ms/iter), node tools/harness/fixedwork-report.ts <tag>-ab-fixedwork.jsonl (X4: us per 100 rounds per arm), node tools/harness/hitch-ab.ts jit-ab as the no-regression guard. Run: node tools/harness/queue.ts tools/harness/queues/jit-ab.json",
